---
manual: element.edit_line.block
lines: [1981, 1982]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $seen = []
  @line = edit_line { $seen << @line.text }
end
----------- test code
click_on edit_line
type_text "hi"

assert_equal ["h", "hi"], $seen, "the block runs on every keystroke"
